    <DataNode elementId="MONOMER-7941" textLabel="MONOMER-7941" type="Protein">
      <Xref identifier="Q68BJ4" dataSource="uniprot" />
      <Graphics centerX="904.255615234375" centerY="712.43310546875" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="pmngroup">The &lt;i&gt;OsCPS1&lt;/i&gt; gene isolated from &lt;i&gt;Oryza sativa&lt;/i&gt; encodes an &lt;i&gt;ent&lt;/i&gt;-copalyl diphosphate synthase (&lt;i&gt;ent&lt;/i&gt;-CPD synthase) |CITS:[15341631]|. This recombinant enzyme expressed as a GST-fusion in &lt;i&gt;E.coli&lt;/i&gt; was shown to convert geranylgeranyl diphosphate (GGDP) into &lt;i&gt;ent&lt;/i&gt;-copalyl diphosphate. Unlike the other |FRAME:CYC2-MONOMER &lt;i&gt;ent&lt;/i&gt;-copalyl diphosphate synthase| encoded by OsCyc2, which is apparently involved in phytoalexins biosynthesis, OsCPS1 is involved in gibberellins biosynthesis |CITS:[15341631],[15075394]|.</Comment>
      <Property key="UniqueID" value="MONOMER-7941" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Phytozome" value="Os02t0278700-01" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Pride" value="Q6ET36" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Interpro" value="IPR008949" />
      <Property key="AlternativeId_Pfam" value="PF03936" />
